**Plain-English Explanation:** Paper trading allows users to practice trading with fake money, and in this case, only Apple (AAPL) and Microsoft (MSFT) are allowed. The maximum order notional is $1000, and users can only buy up to 5 shares of each stock. Additionally, short sales are prohibited.

**If you already own this stock:** Since the value of "User owns stock" is undefined, we cannot provide this warning.
